Portuguese validity vocabulary, derived from OWN-PT and stopwords-iso/stopwords-pt.
The bundled file contains normalized single-word surface labels/function words;
phrases and hyphenated entries are excluded; NFC/casefold then NFD mark stripping
is applied and only ASCII letters are retained. No inflection generation.

Attribution: the OpenWordnet-PT team and contributors, https://github.com/own-pt/openWordnet-PT
Changes: normalized one-word labels only, merged with the MIT function-word list.
This is a validity vocabulary, not a full inflectional spelling dictionary.

